WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.342
Unit nineteen. Medicine Safety!

2
00:00:04.302 --> 00:00:08.123
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:11.614
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.664 --> 00:00:15.409
Today we learn about Medicine Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.302 --> 00:00:19.802
Medicine. Say it with me. Medicine!

6
00:00:23.293 --> 00:00:26.643
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

7
00:00:30.152 --> 00:00:33.402
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

8
00:00:36.882 --> 00:00:40.148
Dose. Say it with me. Dose!

9
00:00:43.649 --> 00:00:47.049
Label. Say it with me. Label!

10
00:00:50.548 --> 00:00:53.765
Candy. Say it with me. Candy!

11
00:00:57.277 --> 00:01:00.727
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

12
00:01:04.215 --> 00:01:07.415
Ask. Say it with me. Ask!

13
00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:19.105
Medicine can help when I am sick, but only an adult should give it to me. Medicine is not candy. The right dose is on the label or from a doctor.

14
00:01:19.155 --> 00:01:20.305
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.646 --> 00:01:26.930
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:28.130
Doctor!

17
00:01:28.894 --> 00:01:34.056
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.106 --> 00:01:35.256
Safe!

19
00:01:36.142 --> 00:01:42.964
Did you know? Some medicines look like candy, so you should always ask an adult before taking anything!

20
00:01:43.014 --> 00:01:45.006
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.709 --> 00:01:52.708
Think and answer. Who should give you medicine?

22
00:01:52.758 --> 00:01:53.908
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.263 --> 00:01:59.988
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.038 --> 00:02:02.615
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

